                    <div class="flex flex-col gap-6 sm:flex-row sm:items-center">
        <img
            src="https://habitkit.app/images/sebastian.webp"
            alt="Sebastian Röhl, the developer of HabitKit"
            width="400"
            height="400"
            loading="lazy"
            class="size-24 shrink-0 rounded-full object-cover shadow-lg ring-1 ring-white/10"
        >
        <p class="text-[16px] leading-[1.7] text-muted text-pretty">
            I'm a 33-year-old independent app developer from Germany. I created HabitKit and <a href="https://tryfocuskit.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-accent-soft transition-colors hover:text-accent">FocusKit</a> because I learned early that <em class="font-semibold text-foam not-italic">if you want to improve something, you have to measure it first</em>. So I started tracking my progress with these apps and improved my life.
        </p>
    </div>

    <p class="text-[16px] leading-[1.7] text-muted text-pretty">
        If you have questions or feedback, please don't hesitate to contact me via
        <a href="https://twitter.com/SebastianRoehl" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-accent-soft transition-colors hover:text-accent">Twitter</a>
        or <a href="mailto:sebaroehl@gmail.com" class="text-accent-soft transition-colors hover:text-accent">email</a>.
        Common questions are answered in the <a href="https://habitkit.app/help#faq" class="text-accent-soft transition-colors hover:text-accent">help center's FAQ</a>,
        and its <a href="https://habitkit.app/help" class="text-accent-soft transition-colors hover:text-accent">topic pages</a> have step-by-step guides for the app itself.
    </p>

